WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.280
<v Nuri>Look at this little tree.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.320
<v Nuri>Sunlight gives warmth, too.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.269
<v Nuri>A real tree takes time to grow.

00:00:19.569 --> 00:00:23.838
<v Nuri>What would you like to thank Allah for today?

00:00:28.038 --> 00:00:33.007
<v Nuri>Allah gives us many good things. Let’s thank Him.
